  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/8f201ab3a46aabeadc.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"שמות אנשים מהפרשה בתמונת &quot;כתב קפצ'ה&quot;\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"311\" data-original-width=\"343\" height=\"290\" src=\"/assets/images/content/8f201ab3a46aabeadc.gif\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מה בקפצ'ה</span></h2></div><h4 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">4 שמות אנשים המוזכרים בפרשה, חבויים בקפצ'ה (</span><span face=\"sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: normal;\">CAPTCHA</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">) שבתמונת הכותרת. גלו אותם.</span></span></h4><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מכנה משותף</span></h2></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לפניכם צמדי מילים שאין ביניהם קשר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אבל, יש להן מכנה משותף - באמצעות מילה שלישית, המתחברת לכל אחת מהן.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈דוגמה:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 חולים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 צדקה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">המילה המשותפת - בעלת 4 אותיות - הנה 'קופת'.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈בונוס:&nbsp;</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אחת מתוצאות החיבור בכל צמד - מוזכרת בפרשה.</span></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><u><b>צמד 1:</b></u></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>אש&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עבודה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><u><b><br /></b></u></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><u><b>צמד 2:</b></u></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חקת&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲🔲</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אהבת&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">צמד 3:</span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 יענה<br />🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 שבע</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></u></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">צמד 4:</span></b></u></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 בקר<br />🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 מוות</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></u></p><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">צמד 5:</span></b></u></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;קדשים</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מעונה</span></span></div><div><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></u></p><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">צמד 6:</span></b></u></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">על 🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;עונות</span></span></div></div><div><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></u></p><p><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">צמד 7:</span></b></u></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 חֶרֶשׂ</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עֲבוֹדָה</span></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתגמים פגומים</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גלו את הפתגמים והביטויים המופיעים בפרשה</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לדוגמה: הרוע נאצ = רועה צאן.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">1👈&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ניספר תשקשקו</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">2👈&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוקם ממי</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">3👈&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">דע רעבה</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">4👈</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עלמת הגר</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">5👈</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חמוץ החלמן</span></p></div></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2></div><div><h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 ברח<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 כלי תאורה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 עובד ספרייה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 סימן טהרה (מהפרשה)&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 שלוחה של מוסד/חברה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 עובד באנייה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 מפתן</span></span></p></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מה בקפצ'ה:</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">איתמר, אליצפן, עזיאל, מישאל</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מכנה משותף:</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">זרה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">עולם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בת</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בן</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">קדש</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ארבע</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כלי</span></span></li></ol></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פתגמים פגומים:</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>סנפיר וקשקשת</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>מקוה מים</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>עד הערב</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>מעלת גרה</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>מחוץ למחנה</span></span></span></li></ol></span></div><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מדרגאות:</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">נס, פנס, ספרן,&nbsp;סנפיר,&nbsp;סניף, ספן, סף</span></div></h3></div>"
